1
00:00:00,815 --> 00:00:03,775
(Sheldon:)Well, that's not much of an apology,
but I'll take it.

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

3
00:00:06,279 --> 00:00:09,199
(Leonard:)Is there anything you'd like
to apologize for?

4
00:00:10,116 --> 00:00:11,536
Yes. Ahem.

5
00:00:11,701 --> 00:00:14,621
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry I tried to blow up your head.

6
00:00:15,955 --> 00:00:17,785
(Sheldon:)It was uncalled for.

7
00:00:18,374 --> 00:00:19,454
(Howard(entering with Raj):)You won't believe this.

8
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:22,875
(Raj:)Somebody got the whole thing
on their cell phone and put it on YouTube.

9
00:00:23,421 --> 00:00:24,801
(Penny:)What?

10
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:28,925
- Now, who would do that?
- That would be me.

11
00:00:29,677 --> 00:00:31,467
(Howard:)Check it out. It's a featured video.

12
00:00:31,637 --> 00:00:33,307
You hit me. You saw that. He hit me.

13
00:00:33,473 --> 00:00:35,723
- You tried to blow up my head.
- So it was working.

14
00:00:35,892 --> 00:00:38,432
(Leonard:)- It was not... You are a nutcase.
- We'll see about that.

15
00:00:38,603 --> 00:00:42,103
You people in the front row, heads up.
This is a splash zone.

16
00:00:42,732 --> 00:00:46,402
Stop it. Quit it. Quit it.

17
00:00:47,195 --> 00:00:48,655
[BOTH GRUNTING]

18
00:00:48,821 --> 00:00:52,111
- Hit you with a Vulcan nerve pinch.
- No pinches. No...!

19
00:00:52,742 --> 00:00:55,162
You should clip your fingernails.
Those hurt.

20
00:00:55,787 --> 00:00:57,327
(Leonard:)Oh, jeez.

21
00:00:57,497 --> 00:00:59,957
Does this suit really look that bad?

22
00:01:00,124 --> 00:01:02,004
(Sheldon:)Forget your suit.
Look at my arms waving.

23
00:01:02,168 --> 00:01:04,708
(Sheldon:)I'm like a flamingo on Ritalin.

24
00:01:06,881 --> 00:01:09,171
(Penny(entering):)Howard, would you like
to explain to me...

25
00:01:09,383 --> 00:01:13,183
(Penny(entering):)...why your Facebook page has a picture
of me sleeping on your shoulder captioned:

26
00:01:13,346 --> 00:01:15,016
"Me and my girlfriend"?

27
00:01:16,349 --> 00:01:19,559
Uh-oh, here comes the talk.

28
00:01:28,694 --> 00:01:30,654
(Sheldon:)- He hit me.
- You tried to blow up my head.

29
00:01:30,822 --> 00:01:33,452
- So it was working.
- It was not... You are a nutcase.

30
00:01:33,616 --> 00:01:34,696
(Sheldon:)We'll see about that.

31
00:01:35,076 --> 00:01:37,116
[IN MANDARIN]

